raw_left: slot_raw is slot_raw & slot_mode=0 { }
raw_right: slot_raw is slot_raw & slot_mode=0 { }
:raw24 slot_raw is ((carmel_issue=2 & slot_mode=1) | (carmel_issue=3 & slot_mode=0)) & slot_raw unimpl
:raw24 raw_left "||" raw_right is (carmel_issue=1 & slot_mode=0 & raw_left); (slot_mode=0 & raw_right) unimpl
:raw48 wide_left,wide_right is (((carmel_issue=4 & wide_left_mode=0) | (carmel_issue=5 & wide_left_mode=1)) & wide_right_mode=1) & wide_left & wide_right unimpl
